I bring the hot Kande Pohe to the table.
The smell of the poha is very good.
I serve poha on everyone's plate.
First I give a plate to Neha, then to Amit.
Amit says, "Maya, give me a spoon quickly!"
I give spoons to both of them.
Neha eats the poha and smiles.
She says, "Wow Maya, this is very tasty!"
Amit also eats the poha.
He says, "Yes, its Maharashtrian flavor is absolutely perfect."
"The taste of peanuts and lemon in it is very good."
I feel very happy hearing this.
I say to them, "Both of you eat more."
Amit laughs and says, "First I finish this plate."
"After that, give me two more spoons of poha!"
We all eat the meal comfortably together.
This is a very good day with friends.
